      "biography": "A Jewish Journal article dated October 11, 2012 identifies Rabbi Howard Kosovske as serving Congregation Tifereth Israel from 2008 through the article's publication. His final year of service is not yet verified.\n\nThe archive includes a photograph of Rabbi Kosovske at a 2012 shofar presentation (CTI-024) and a separate newspaper photograph outside the synagogue (CTI-008). The latter article inconsistently spells his surname Kosovke and Kosokove; the dated Jewish Journal article uses Kosovske.",
